<title>GERMANY: Puma H1 net profit rises 6.1 percent.</title>
<headline>Puma H1 net profit rises 6.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1997	  1996</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   41.2    vs 38.8</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     44.4    vs 41.2</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   44.1    vs 42.6</p>
<p>    Group sales				  275.7   vs 260.2</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 2.67    vs 2.52 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear group is Puma AG. The company said the growth in sales came amid a 4.8 percent growth in footwear sales, 8.1 percent growth in textiles and 14.9 percent in accessories.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
